{
 "id": "f3d1c4d7-babd-47da-8093-ecc757edc599",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I'm a Villainess, but I Won't Live Like One"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "악녀지만, 그렇게 살지 않겠습니다"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Aknyeojiman, Geureohge Salji Anhgessseupnida"
   },
   {
    "en": "I May Be a Villainess, but I Won't Live My Life That Way"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Bianca is just another noble lady with a simple dream: to marry into a duchy and enjoy a life of luxury.\n\nBut everything changes when she stumbles upon a book—one that casts her as the villainess, doomed to stand in the way of her real-life fiancé’s love story with a commoner girl. As Bianca realizes the book accurately depicts her own fate, she refuses to accept her tragic ending.\n\nCan she rewrite her story, or is she simply destined to become a villainess?",
   "ko": "[연재 요일: 매주 목요연재] \n\n제국 최고의 미녀인 나, 비앙카 크로포트. \n우연히 읽게 된 소설에서 약혼자인 리카르도와 내 이름을 발견하게 되는데… \n“싫어, 그렇게 살고 싶지 않아.” \n나, 비앙카 크로포트는 책이 정해놓은 운명을 거스르기로 했다."
  },
